msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………."

#: scenario6:scenario6_9A86FC9B_89CD_40AF_AC2D_F93A8A50470C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da1a05a33684a1bbefd75bea56523f821ac5084816188ea820725fae9440df00
#. default-sha256: 0fc24993ca5b4dc65f77bc0dca601596a088831a97619def2240a91c2a58ee70
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9A86FC9B_89CD_40AF_AC2D_F93A8A50470C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it didn’t matter if it was all an illusion; ⟪k:1⟫the gentle breeze blowing in through "
"the window felt wonderful."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫비록 망상이라도―― ⟪k:2⟫창문을 통해 들어오는 바람이 몹시 아늑하여,"

#: scenario6:scenario6_2BB1070F_5121_4B4C_87C2_E5392817163A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b00c818d0ac26ffa170ad3a809a2354e59a11cb05812303df6f836da30b5438f
#. default-sha256: 84c36c46ebc378cad457db83e2d997a3588c7ed6154ee83da33336a8f9c0bf44
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2BB1070F_5121_4B4C_87C2_E5392817163A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The smell of grass, the chirping of birds, the glistening blue sky...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫it was like a "
"thousand memories rushing back all at once,⟪k:3⟫and it brought tears to my eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫풀 내음, ⟪k:1⟫새가 지저귀는 소리, ⟪k:2⟫반짝반짝 빛나는 푸른 하늘…… 그 모든 게 그리워서, ⟪k:3⟫"
"저는 절로 ⟪k:4⟫눈물을 흘렸어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_FEAE7690_F01A_4749_B284_1BBFF2039512
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db6874278ca7bc3e8adb3d85b7a2fb33a4ba28f0807a5405e70271c1e538d0fd
#. default-sha256: 2929c58d99d45a4260a4253d33b3bf1b73dbee9df3c7ff94b28ae673d1d7b24a
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_FEAE7690_F01A_4749_B284_1BBFF2039512"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And as she always did, the witch’s voice crushed my elation,⟪k:1⟫dragging me back to reality."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫――제 감동을 날리고 ⟪k:1⟫현실로 되돌리는 건 ⟪k:2⟫늘 마녀의 목소리였어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_F4C5E076_10F9_423D_AE33_EDC7C998E390
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7729fbd7552cac69984e55088824700718546b37ad94fd4d893a1550620d25d9
#. default-sha256: defb5f763202933e1d3cc8e480574776b7fc30cace1f9f4c26b42268ec633f1b
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F4C5E076_10F9_423D_AE33_EDC7C998E390"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫for it was that moment that began my true decline."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제 진정한 추락의 시작이었으니까요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_24048DAB_589E_445E_9473_514B697F5F20
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97d955e80e43f9e4975aa42a4315ebfbf391fd54f3d37862dfbbb7b6850e4ab8
#. default-sha256: 18d16ab4734e7c451502138ea4ea3e37c84dd0809efd6fc86248e427709525d0
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_24048DAB_589E_445E_9473_514B697F5F20"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Have you already forgotten?⟪k:1⟫Oh, good heavens... ⟪k:2⟫Do you have your head on straight, "
"my dear?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫잊으셨어요? ⟪k:1⟫어머나 참…… 당신 머리는 잘 돌아가는 거 맞나요?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_9D80C2BC_6E8A_4074_B8A5_966D67262FB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3cd26a7bd53bd166d2a35eb8aadba56758a45c08f9192199eb4fe92e0289de2
#. default-sha256: 39c41ae243f50d736870b2afdb001ebc70b5ca64fb1b340463f94cc98bce829e
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9D80C2BC_6E8A_4074_B8A5_966D67262FB5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...It looks like someone’s here."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이건 그 준비에 불과해요. ⟪k:1⟫……자, ⟪k:2⟫누가 왔나 본데요?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_5ECC5EC6_1C2A_4C00_8926_9D15828AFB8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf99ece088e1e58e619fd99158893a3e3e00dae2d9739cf78043ecfad8609865
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_5ECC5EC6_1C2A_4C00_8926_9D15828AFB8B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario6:scenario6_7B26F9EF_ABA1_4645_A700_F7B61B22ED50
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30c2fe76bdbc5851834cc3886fd3993f386fe6894223a894c99e53193f98c8c1
#. default-sha256: da1ba7e3bdf8545f2cdf2764a94980cd33c41765f4ef2d152b55f10b53004b3f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_7B26F9EF_ABA1_4645_A700_F7B61B22ED50"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Now go on.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m quite looking forward to this..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫자, ⟪k:1⟫가 보세요. ⟪k:2⟫기대 많이 할게요……."

#: scenario6:scenario6_C3C24115_B057_484A_BDCF_F58B0F781072
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf99ece088e1e58e619fd99158893a3e3e00dae2d9739cf78043ecfad8609865
