msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario6:scenario6_AB61422F_38F0_4498_9F59_6F580BBF1977
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee8e585e85b9d3121875a29d3aca9e01efe24d2f8dba229648fb78b1d1452b53
#. default-sha256: 3697fe808f0e99b1e30c9c85a852eb6b80192ee681fa24349b3dee67b5c04108
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_AB61422F_38F0_4498_9F59_6F580BBF1977"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫(The bar has been removed...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫(……빗장이 ⟪k:6⟫풀렸어……)"

#: scenario6:scenario6_14D5B97B_1F9B_4876_AF46_557077243F79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35194584618a5e1d36afe7e8f8cf09ef315c3b620a839ded426c3e15f723d572
#. default-sha256: fe45b50836fa9356653297cbc8dd668002ae8cc3bb40d797db07be67d90ddb23
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_14D5B97B_1F9B_4876_AF46_557077243F79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫…………."

#: scenario6:scenario6_C90C966B_0C56_4001_9E0A_B23960B14CFB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58ebabb2701be91e3800ec23a7675d05222811481e36ab29345e49fe2e7563e6
#. default-sha256: 7bf8068994d715b555c1590fe0363214092a269c96ad6937890f7bd4032211e6
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_C90C966B_0C56_4001_9E0A_B23960B14CFB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I felt like I had stepped into Heaven on Earth.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I know it sounds melodramatic, so "
"please don’t laugh."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫제 눈에는 ⟪k:1⟫그 광경이 지상낙원 같았어요. ⟪k:2⟫과장이 심하다고 ⟪k:3⟫웃진 말아 주세요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_0DA68A78_8B28_414F_AC1B_6DC4D5DE8857
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfa68f193923ea664ed43e3876e5a7814714d4954bbd57b42f8f22d671a63d29
#. default-sha256: 55a1ef98730f7039d1b9a08e9523db34fb382f755fd0589f4d00a5070f2d8d25
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0DA68A78_8B28_414F_AC1B_6DC4D5DE8857"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I wondered where I was, of course, but I neither shouted nor jumped in surprise."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫당연히 ⟪k:2⟫여기가 어디냔 의문이 들었지만, ⟪k:3⟫놀라거나 소리치지도 않고――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_5AF7073A_DE35_4B5E_8F2F_E3EF7A7C5BEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe2ce1ede09017223e4b3504e1924360e55ca0382fb6a9656c11bb9b0f231086
#. default-sha256: 75a1e5a30a3010f8f83de78d09bae5dcad533f7b091dd3989c248a9c4779e9a5
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_5AF7073A_DE35_4B5E_8F2F_E3EF7A7C5BEB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Instead, I found myself accepting of my circumstances, as unnatural as they might have been."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 비상식적인 사태를 ⟪k:1⟫고스란히 받아들이는 제가 있었어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_84026324_DC24_4E9D_A5A1_ECEADDA41B4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99f831e7ccc7e243052cca220adc7de8638407289b6f1678a6962c20d29b4803
#. default-sha256: d582e51b52048729c1995a97d755be29af5e396f74144e905c177b76e06fb352
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_84026324_DC24_4E9D_A5A1_ECEADDA41B4D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫E⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫gad⟪k:7⟫... ⟪k:8⟫could this road be any bloody worse?⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫It’s in dire need of paving, on top of everything else..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫허이고야…… 길이 아주 험하기 짝이 없어. ⟪k:4⟫이거 ⟪k:5⟫도로 포장도 해야겠구"
"먼……."

#: scenario6:scenario6_2AE98630_DED7_4A51_9FC8_3E63CEDD1BE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85dc6f5b88c31cd177b92af34e103f82235942a3a843d0a0e57151749e3eeed6
#. default-sha256: 800aa44ed6d66fcf99113edaf810e98e1cfcb099750781c947bc7faf0ae95fbb
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2AE98630_DED7_4A51_9FC8_3E63CEDD1BE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(He’s speaking a different language...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(언어가 ⟪k:1⟫달라………)"

#: scenario6:scenario6_AD7BDF71_DE74_4C0B_A019_0F4BC66C5C25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47c243491efb16b9d8ad32872c62158498de8c6b9c7ed6ea3515cca554793a14
#. default-sha256: 925781ad503fe08028c344820e6c37fec148efef660ad4ccf53b0dda563b7d2e
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_AD7BDF71_DE74_4C0B_A019_0F4BC66C5C25"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The middle-aged man approached me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫From his attire and the way he held himself,⟪k:3⟫"
"he appeared to be upper-class."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫제게 다가온 건 ⟪k:1⟫초로의 남성이었어요. ⟪k:2⟫차림새나 행동거지를 보건대 ⟪k:3⟫고귀한 신분인 "
"게 헤아려졌죠."

#: scenario6:scenario6_D8A6A93F_8C97_4C40_BE00_67411E6A59E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4988d47019312b94ec4b0a36d3d1ee8970271802e35f9a778c2ec3673c292711
#. default-sha256: 41e569ebf322ad4fb23e51d622c357093f3c8129fbb036d404aa87e081597b90
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D8A6A93F_8C97_4C40_BE00_67411E6A59E5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the words coming out of his mouth were not in the language I had grown up speaking."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 그 남성이 쓰는 언어는 ⟪k:1⟫제가 쓰던 것과 달랐어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_84959456_0539_4B5D_AF25_55E7A84A63C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b8d31b229207745dd0e7e84fb2544f481e2b2b5ac33d46cd74a0448b838e0b0
#. default-sha256: e77d5d53202ed2c013f65685054da9f3abf06c0ea2c6fed96752a055aae4d3c4
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_84959456_0539_4B5D_AF25_55E7A84A63C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the longer I stood there staring at him absentmindedly, the more incredulous he became."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 남성은 제가 멍하니 있을수록 ⟪k:1⟫미심쩍어하는 눈길을 보냈어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_8ADCDDB8_5600_41C6_A1AF_7B1F0729A20A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b46e45e3776cb5841db76100d5f397a1263876204b7b62e4623792dca9c62ed4
#. default-sha256: e6169083abdd65dfe0eea17620e0b05e24ac645e3a161a555def3655bdc39a77
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_8ADCDDB8_5600_41C6_A1AF_7B1F0729A20A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Fortunately, I suppose, I was able to understand bits and pieces of what he had said."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그나마 다행인 건 ⟪k:1⟫제가 ⟪k:2⟫그 남성의 말을 조금 알아들었단 점이었죠."

#: scenario6:scenario6_C0FF212D_9A8A_4FD9_B75B_B36E08296C84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86a5486798089e53b28c215ef1739c615f5b0e0240eb4d582ce80f8f0f0d2997
#. default-sha256: b3a57214d525f586618739afba747485f4aad6f50dd267c00ab767a3e035d5a1
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_C0FF212D_9A8A_4FD9_B75B_B36E08296C84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As merchants in the capital, my family did business with people from other countries, and as "
"a result, I had learned a handful of words."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫네, ⟪k:1⟫저는 수도에서 장사를 했기 때문에 ⟪k:2⟫외국 사람하고도 거래하곤 했어요. ⟪k:3⟫그때 "
"⟪k:4⟫언어를 몇 가지 외웠죠."

#: scenario6:scenario6_AC59AA1D_9A37_43DA_B6EB_7C8511AFCA3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa33e09fa5fbdb5c5a4786b5a3b6c632d6d1dfc44d60fced7538285989290b99
#. default-sha256: a0c1e1f43b994657fe11938084b1794fd85e13351a84966a9501a4d31a9f786b
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_AC59AA1D_9A37_43DA_B6EB_7C8511AFCA3E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The problem was... ⟪k:1⟫it had been so long ago, I had no confidence whatsoever in my "
"ability to hold a conversation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫단, ⟪k:1⟫매우 옛날 일이기에……, ⟪k:2⟫제대로 말할 자신은 ⟪k:3⟫전혀 없었지만요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_DE67DD51_9738_4809_AAEF_55F0D3BC8BCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbd5448f67d9603f80df0a3225b40e4c01b6cb6378fa24e9dbcd0dadbf62efd7
#. default-sha256: 93f3feddaf06030779ef0df0d9c591a48ed0123160b3340d7c1f2d5f3d091a90
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DE67DD51_9738_4809_AAEF_55F0D3BC8BCA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I am... ⟪k:3⟫I am a servant..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저……, ⟪k:1⟫저는…… ⟪k:2⟫이 저택의 고용인이에요……."

#: scenario6:scenario6_8FC453C1_D9B9_4A17_85F8_0BED6E133217
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90c01bfd6cb90dee8e809a2fde29542b7658d5aad9143a9f189d217acaeed676
#. default-sha256: cf52d8f458bb2ecda1b1c46aea78c6bc568e9f393d5a9e9f80ddd20ef626c5fd
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_8FC453C1_D9B9_4A17_85F8_0BED6E133217"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...You weren’t informed?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Bloody hell. Off to a great start, I see.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Well, "
"what can you do, I guess..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……편지를 못 받았나? ⟪k:1⟫앞날이 걱정되는구먼. ⟪k:2⟫에잉 쯧쯧, ⟪k:3⟫별 수 없지……."

#: scenario6:scenario6_085A38AC_6F3D_4699_981C_C0B7E83EE3E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80cc951633e44f492398c7372e0acc55ff4e5b05c71676bc1e268ab380cf04b4
