"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Is ⟪k:3⟫that⟪k:4⟫ so? All right then, starting tomorrow, I’m tripling your lessons!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그 말 똑똑히 들었다? ⟪k:3⟫좋아, ⟪k:4⟫내일부터 학습 시간을 3배로 늘려 주지!"

