msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In that time, the mansion underwent a number of decor changes, as Hayden brought in "
"sculptors to work on different areas of the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫2년이 경과한 저택은 ⟪k:1⟫기존과 조금 달라졌어요. ⟪k:2⟫헤이든이 이따금 ⟪k:3⟫도시에서 조각가를 "
"불러 ⟪k:4⟫저택을 손봤거든요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_0A84EEF8_E0B4_478D_B500_D7EC3B50E9A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdb7fca16df4001cfb0cf31545df4e9f82bd1ed2d5fef6b5e8d8161dbddaa28e
#. default-sha256: 749a5c249f757cb01bb79b76cd42f792430b61b92153b275c349e081cbd284a6
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0A84EEF8_E0B4_478D_B500_D7EC3B50E9A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He also sealed off rooms that were not in use—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫such as the observation tower and "
"the chapel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그리고 ⟪k:1⟫헤이든이 쓰지 않는 방은 폐쇄하기도 했어요. ⟪k:2⟫감시탑이나 ⟪k:3⟫스테인드 글라스"
